@keycloakUrl = http://localhost:8081
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Development token: acme tenant admin
# Direct access grants/password grant are development-only. Future frontend login should use Authorization Code + PKCE.
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/insightflow/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&
client_id=insightflow-dev-client&
username=acme-admin&
password=acme-admin

### Development token: acme support agent
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/insightflow/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&
client_id=insightflow-dev-client&
username=acme-agent&
password=acme-agent

### Development token: platform admin
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/insightflow/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&
client_id=insightflow-dev-client&
username=platform-admin&
password=platform-admin

### Platform admin: list tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tenant admin: create customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Slug: acme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "customer-auth-1001",
  "email": "auth1001@example.com",
  "fullName": "Auth User 1001",
  "plan": "PREMIUM"
}

### Support agent: read automation rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/automation/rules?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Slug: acme

### Tenant mismatch: expected 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/feedbacks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Slug: beta-soft

### Missing token: expected 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
X-Tenant-Slug: acme
